WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.533
A woman who

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:01.401
was allegedly

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.402
held against her

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.169
will for nearly

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:05.405
a year is free this morning

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:07.674
after escaping from her alleged kidnaper

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:10.410
by fleeing to a New Jersey gas station.

00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:11.678
Here's her escape.

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:12.912
It was caught on camera.

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:13.880
You see the woman

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:14.948
who's not been identified,

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:16.850
she's running, she's barefoot.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.151
She's only in a T-shirt

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:20.153
in 42nd degree weather.

00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:21.554
And you see the man

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:22.989
that was closely following her,

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:24.524
he tries to get in,

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:26.760
but she deadbolts the door

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.528
when he realizes he can't get inside.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.363
He turns around and leaves.

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:31.898
And that's when the owner steps

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:33.033
in helping her

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.268
get to the back of the gas station

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:37.470
where they call police.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.773
Now, her alleged abductor is 57 year

00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:41.207
old James Perillo,

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:42.942
and he's now behind bars

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:45.311
on kidnaping and assault charges.

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:45.945
Authorities say

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:46.746
that he choked her

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:48.581
multiple times, that at one point

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:50.083
he took away her cell phone

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:51.551
and used her credit cards

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:53.987
and isolated her from her family.

00:00:53.987 --> 00:00:55.922
They also say he goes by different names

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:58.091
and may have actually done this before

00:00:58.091 --> 00:00:59.759
in other states.

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:01.694
CNN has reached out to an attorney

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:03.196
listed for Perillo,

00:01:03.196 --> 00:01:05.598
but we've yet to hear a response.

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:06.032
Joining us

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:06.599
this morning

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:08.334
is one of the heroes of this story.

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:09.969
The owner of that gas station,

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:11.371
Bobby Madsen,

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:12.072
who helped

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:14.541
keep the woman safe until police arrived.

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:16.076
Bobby, good morning.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:16.743
We're so grateful

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:18.878
that you're sharing the story with us.

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:21.815
Walk us through what that day was like.

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:23.950
When did you first see her

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:25.418
and realize that something was wrong?

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:29.055
Hi.

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:29.956
Good morning.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.326
Yeah, it was just a regular day

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:34.260
at the gas station.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.161
I was in the backroom

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:36.096
doing paperwork

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:38.465
and my employee was in the front

00:01:38.465 --> 00:01:40.433
just having a little break.

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:41.468
And all of a sudden

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:43.136
we hear this screaming and yelling.

00:01:43.136 --> 00:01:44.804
And I look up on the camera,

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:45.672
there's somebody

00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:47.674
running on the side of the building.

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:48.942
Then there at the front,

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:50.276
and I could see the woman

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:52.445
and the men right behind her.

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:54.214
Excuse me.

00:01:54.214 --> 00:01:57.417
And so my employee gave me

00:01:57.417 --> 00:01:58.852
and her come into the store,

00:01:58.852 --> 00:01:59.853
and they locked the door.

00:01:59.853 --> 00:02:01.554
By the time I get out to the office,

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:03.323
I see the guys trying to open the door.

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:05.458
But we kind of look at each other

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:08.761
and he is gone and she is frantic.

00:02:08.795 --> 00:02:10.463
She is shaken.

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:12.298
She was really, really scared.

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:13.533
You could tell

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:15.568
I couldn't grasp in the first 10 seconds

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:16.503
what was going on.

00:02:16.503 --> 00:02:18.538
I just knew that this woman needed help.

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:20.507
My employer knew this woman needed help.

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:21.574
Help her. I'll get her in.

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:22.842
And my employee told me

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:24.811
that she was screaming on the way here

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:26.146
that I've been kidnaped.

00:02:26.146 --> 00:02:28.114
This man has kept me for too long.

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:28.982
And that's exactly

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:30.049
what she repeated to me

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:31.651
when she got in the office.

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:33.553
So we just got her to sit down

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:35.755
and give her a safe place and told her

00:02:35.755 --> 00:02:37.023
we're calling the police.

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:38.892
Do not worry. Nobody's coming in here.

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:40.693
While Bobby,

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:41.861
I'm sure she's

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:44.330
grateful to you and your employee

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:47.167
You said you made contact

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:49.636
