00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:57.243
I'm just.

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:57.810
You know what?

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.879
It was almost

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:01.681
any moment of.

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:02.782
Yes, him being mad.

00:03:02.782 --> 00:03:05.084
And I guess also realizing,

00:03:05.084 --> 00:03:08.755
oh, like I'm in trouble.

00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:10.290
So when she's

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.525
screaming and yelling,

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:14.060
what are you trying to say to her?

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:17.363
What was the approach like

00:03:18.231 --> 00:03:19.832
it was just that

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:22.202
it was just an normal human approach.

00:03:22.202 --> 00:03:22.835
Like, you know what?

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:24.270
You're going to be okay.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:26.005
There's nobody coming in her

