00:03:34.314 --> 00:03:36.249
so she doesn't get any more worried. And

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:39.686
she she was desperately in need of help.

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:40.787
And, like I said,

00:03:40.787 --> 00:03:41.955
couldn't really understand

00:03:41.955 --> 00:03:42.956
for the first few seconds

00:03:42.956 --> 00:03:44.123
what was going on.

00:03:44.123 --> 00:03:45.758
But you could see

00:03:45.758 --> 00:03:47.293
