gave me my employee

00:04:05.278 --> 00:04:06.980
got on the phone with the police,

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:08.281
and I just kept telling her, like,

00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:10.550
do not worry, he is not coming in here.

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:12.385
Nobody's coming and half right now.

